{"id":"661158","name":"炒面线","author":"杨洁的家常菜谱","authorId":"8665777","desc":"","cover":"images/661158/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面线","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱段","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆芽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱丝","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面线过水。","img":"images/661158/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋炒好备用。","img":"images/661158/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞出滴点油不让它粘住。","img":"images/661158/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放油炒洋葱丝和豆芽。","img":"images/661158/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"然后放入虾仁，虾仁我切了一下。","img":"images/661158/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后放入鸡蛋。","img":"images/661158/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入葱段，本来是放蒜苗，可是没买到所以用葱段代替。","img":"images/661158/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入面线，酱汁先调好，酱油蚝油少许味精。","img":"images/661158/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒，用筷子比较好。","img":"images/661158/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"完成啦！","img":"images/661158/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}